{"version":1,"key":"quest:46","content":{"id":46,"title":"CSS 中的 isolation 属性是干什么用的？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:46","type":"quest","id":46},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"isolation 属性与层叠上下文的应用","meta":"","excerpt":"isolation 属性用于控制元素是否应该创建一个新的层叠上下文（stacking context）。 语法 isolation: auto | isolate; auto: 默认值。元素不会显式地创建一个新的层叠上下文，除非其他属性（如 opacity 小于 1）触发了层叠上下文的创建。isolate: 元素总是会","target":{"key":"card:661","type":"card","id":661},"citeKey":"card:661"}],"trail":[{"time":1745152395428,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1745216115481,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1745216115481,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1745152395428,"updateTime":1745152395428,"resolvedTime":1745216115481},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1745152395428}}